  'Ukraine\'s General Staff reported 221 combat clashes over the past day, most on the Pokrovsk and Huliaipole directions; it said the Russian army carried out 73 air strikes, dropping 255 guided bombs, and used 8444 kamikaze drones. By 22:00 the next day the General Staff counted 231 clashes, most on the Kostiantynivka and Pokrovsk directions.',
  None]))

cards.append(C('1011-ft-assassination-plots', [9315, 6985, 7866, 6986],
